1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,460
Nabi ni sangat berlapang dada.

2
00:00:03,460 --> 00:00:04,930
Orang yang bunuh bapa saudara dia

3
00:00:04,930 --> 00:00:06,460
pun dia terima.

4
00:00:08,120 --> 00:00:12,740
Bila masuk Islamnya Wahsyi, Nabi

5
00:00:12,740 --> 00:00:13,560
kata apa?

6
00:00:13,560 --> 00:00:14,680
Allahu yadhak.

7
00:00:14,680 --> 00:00:16,510
Allah ketawa, kata Nabi.

8
00:00:16,510 --> 00:00:19,220
Maksudnya satu perkara yang lucu.

9
00:00:19,220 --> 00:00:21,410
Sahabat-sahabat bertanya, apa dia

10
00:00:21,410 --> 00:00:22,760
wahai Rasulullah?

11
00:00:22,760 --> 00:00:23,320
Kenapa?

12
00:00:23,320 --> 00:00:25,760
Al-qatil wal maqtul fil jannah.

13
00:00:25,760 --> 00:00:28,120
Pembunuh dan yang kena bunuh masuk

14
00:00:28,120 --> 00:00:29,380
syurga, kata Nabi.

15
00:00:29,380 --> 00:00:30,860
Siapa dia pembunuh?

16
00:00:30,860 --> 00:00:33,220
Wahsyi yang bunuh Saidina Hamzah

17
00:00:33,220 --> 00:00:34,900
dalam peperangan Uhud.

18
00:00:34,900 --> 00:00:35,760
Kenapa?

19
00:00:35,760 --> 00:00:38,780
Kerana dia masuk Islam akhirnya.

20
00:00:38,780 --> 00:00:41,040
Yang kena bunuh siapa?

21
00:00:41,040 --> 00:00:42,580
Saidina Hamzah.

22
00:00:42,580 --> 00:00:44,130
Pun Islam juga.

23
00:00:44,320 --> 00:00:46,600
Sahabat Nabi juga,

24
00:00:47,220 --> 00:00:51,320
sepupu Nabi, bapa saudara Nabi.

25
00:00:51,320 --> 00:00:52,520
Hamzah.

26
00:00:52,810 --> 00:00:55,450
Dah tentulah syurga sebab dia mati

27
00:00:55,450 --> 00:00:58,080
syahid di Medan Uhud.

28
00:00:58,080 --> 00:01:00,805
Jadi Nabi kata, Allahu yadhak,

29
00:01:00,805 --> 00:01:03,040
al-qatil wal maqtul fil jannah.

30
00:01:03,040 --> 00:01:04,710
Allah ketawa kepada pembunuh.

31
00:01:04,710 --> 00:01:08,420
Pembunuh dan yang kena bunuh masuk syurga.

32
00:01:08,420 --> 00:01:12,040
Jadi begitu Islam ni, agama yang

33
00:01:12,040 --> 00:01:15,860
memberikan peluang kepada orang lain

34
00:01:15,860 --> 00:01:18,160
untuk masuk Islam.

35
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:22,220
Jangan kita tutup peluang-peluang

36
00:01:23,310 --> 00:01:24,510
itu.
